        p_reg_s = float(pc_sec.get("pf_reg", 0.005))
        lines.extend(
            [
                "",
                f"## PSOL Predictive Control Performance (`AR({p_ord_s})`, "
                "`mkARPF` + `applyARPF` + `mfilt`)",
                "",
                "- **Architecture**: `mfilt` reconstructs per-frame pseudo-open-loop (PSOL) "
                "modal wavefronts `aolN_modevalOL[t] = WFSfact * modevalWFS[t] - modevalDM[t - d]` "
                "using fractional lag `d` and optical gain `WFSfact` identified in-loop by "
                "`mfilt.testOL`. Double-buffered `aolN_modevalOL_buff` slices (`256` frames) "
                f"feed `cacaopc.mkARPF`, which solves per-mode regularized Wiener `AR({p_ord_s})` "
                f"predictors (`reglambda = {p_reg_s}`, strict DC stability cap `|sum(w)| <= 0.985` "
                "and L2 noise-gain bound `||w||_2^2 <= 1.35`). `cacaopc.applyARPF` evaluates "
                "forward-predicted `aolN_modevalPF` in `< 1 us`/frame and synchronizes with "
                f"`mfilt` (`PF.mixcoeff = {p_mix_s:.2f}` weighted by modal `mPFmixfact`).",
                "",
                "| Loop Stage | Modes | Rate [Hz] | PSOL Lag [fr / ms] | `WFSfact` | "
                "Updates (`N_train`) | OL / ZOH / Pred RMS | Lag Var Red. | Timeouts |",
                "| :--- | ---: | ---: | :---: | ---: | :---: | :---: | ---: | ---: |",
