        taps_fmt = ", ".join(f"{float(v):+.3f}" for v in taps_s)
        lines.extend(
            [
                "",
                "## Two-WFS + Inter-Stage DM Telemetry Calibration "
                "(`B = Mab A + Mdb D`, `mlt.sysid`)",
                "",
                "- **Method**: Synchronizes upstream Stage-1 WFS `A` (`aol1_modevalWFS`, "
                f"`{int(c2d_sec.get('dim_a', 60))}` modes), downstream Stage-2 WFS `B` "
                f"(`aol2_modevalWFS`, `{int(c2d_sec.get('dim_b', 40))}` modes), and inter-stage "
                f"DM `D` (`aol2_modevalDM`, `{int(c2d_sec.get('dim_d', 40))}` modes) onto the "
                "common `1 kHz` exposure window using `mlt.tlmsync` (`window` + piecewise-ZOH "
                f"`expint` at auto-identified lags `lag_DB = {float(c2d_sec.get('lag_db_fr', 2.5)):.2f} fr`, "
                f"`lag_AB = {float(c2d_sec.get('lag_ab_fr', 0.0)):+.2f} fr`). Applying the identical "
                f"scalar causal `AR({w_ord_s})` whitening filter `W(z)` (taps `[{taps_fmt}]`) to "
                "`(A, B, D)` preserves `Mab` and `Mdb` exactly while breaking low-frequency "
                "closed-loop collinearity (`D ≈ -Mdb^+ Mab A`), enabling unbiased block-regularized "
                "Schur-complement identification of `Mdb`, DM-free open-loop refinement of `Mab`, "
